How the reference pictures align with the target video — Picture 1 (from Shot 1) aligns with the 0.00-second mark of the target video; Picture 2 (from Shot 1) aligns with the 5.00-second mark of the target video.

integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Continuous shot from inside the dark pump room toward the huge open steel double door full of bright morning light. The camera does not move. Start exactly at Picture 1: the young woman, seen from behind as a dark silhouette, keeps walking away out through the doorway into the light and disappears into the glow by about 2 seconds. Then the two heavy steel door leaves slide in from both sides, the band of daylight narrowing steadily, until they meet and close completely, exactly as in Picture 2, by about 4.3 seconds; the room falls into darkness and stays dark and still to the end. No text appears.

overall_soundscape: Her footsteps fading outside, morning birdsong, then the long grinding rumble of heavy steel doors rolling shut and a deep metallic boom as they close, then silence with a faint hum.

non_diegetic_music: N/A
